First public release.

Loop CR Review reads CGM and pump data exported from Glooko, Nightscout, LibreView or Dexcom Clarity and turns it into a report with AGP, consensus metrics and the courses per meal – entirely on the device, no cloud, no account. The assessment is designed for CamAPS FX and can be switched off, leaving the measured values alone.

Not a medical device: no diagnosis, no treatment advice.
